  "headline": "God of War Ragnarok midgame walkthrough (Missions 5-8): Vanaheim upgrade window and recommended gear roles",
  "description": "A midgame plan around Vanaheim: use the River Delta detour to build a single strong foundation set, then return to story with stable runics and controlled crowd fights.",
