    "best armor midgame",
    "skill priorities"
  ],
  "articleBody": "Scope: The Path missions 5-8. Your goal is to assemble one clear midgame foundation set (by role) so later missions do not become level-gap walls.\n\n1) Goals\n- Make Blades your crowd-control engine\n- Tune shield choices so guard-break pressure does not collapse your loop\n- Use the River Delta detour to upgrade weapons and armor on schedule\n\n2) Skill priorities\n- Blades: pull/AoE/burn style control first\n- Shield: reinforce your chosen defense loop\n- Companion: stagger/status tools to create healing and punish windows\n\n3) Gear roles\n- Status/control set: reduces incoming damage by limiting enemy actions\n- Stability set: scales best with difficulty\n\n4) Detour steps\n1) when River Delta opens, detour for materials\n2) upgrade weapons, then armor\n3) lock short runics\n4) return to story\n\nRelated: pair with the progression playbook checklist.",
